# 5. Logs

When the API doesn't start, don't immediately change code.

Check:

```text
Visual Studio
   ↓
Output
   ↓
Debug / ASP.NET Core logs
```

Also check the terminal if you're running with:

```bash
dotnet run
```

Look for:

```text
Exception
Error
Failed
Unable
Invalid
```

The first meaningful exception is often the best place to start.

